  "id": "RAW_d1e0e2d25d",
  "title": "Agent 直取企业网络最高权限，用时不到 10 小时",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NjA0NjgyMA==&mid=2651346270&idx=1&sn=429baafa5cd42c128d90faf234ac4d28",
  "date": "2026-09-06 18:00:00",
  "author": "FreeBuf",
  "siteName": "FreeBuf",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><span>FreeBuf</span> <span>2026-09-06 18:00</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">上海</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260906210301_726938d.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>AIAgent不到10小时攻破企业网络并窃取root凭据。</p>\n  <p style=\"margin:0 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"FreeBuf\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.1328125\" data-w=\"640\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:100%;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260906210301_eb3fde1.gif\"></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"503862599\" data-ratio=\"1.4828897338403042\" data-s=\"300,640\" type=\"block\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1052\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260906210301_4c2010c.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">根据Palo Alto Networks旗下Unit42发布的最新事件响应报告，一名配备前沿人工智能模型的人类攻击者在不到10小时内攻破了一个企业网络并夺取了root凭据——而这一时间线通常需要人类红队花费大约两周才能完成。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">该威胁行为者在勒索谈判期间告诉Unit42调查人员，他们依赖前沿AI模型配合针对特定攻击场景的智能体化AI框架来实现入侵自动化。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">操作者并未手动执行攻击的每个阶段，而是指挥AI Agent实时监控、评估、行动和重新规划，将超过50种不同的MITRE ATT&amp;CK技术压缩进一个自动化循环中。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Unit42指出，此次攻击并未依赖0Day漏洞利用或异常精妙的攻击手法，其速度和规模完全是通过AI辅助的运营效率实现的。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"text-align: center;margin-left: 16px;margin-right: 16px;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"1.3333333333333333\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"503862601\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260906210302_9e226a1.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#000000;margin:0 0 4px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Part</span><span style=\"color:#00af00;\"><span leaf=\"\">01</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#00af00;margin:4px 0 16px 0;padding:0 16px;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI Agent攻破企业网络</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">在通过攻破一个可公开访问的Web服务获得初始访问权限后，这些Agent建立了内网隧道，并部署了一个自动化侦察Agent来测绘内部微服务。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"image\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6826086956521739\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"690\" data-imgfileid=\"503862578\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260906210301_2454ee6.jpeg\"></span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">随后，子Agent全面搜索了企业代码仓库，收集硬编码的令牌和服务密码。攻击者随后利用这些暴露的令牌渗透到该组织的密钥管理系统，提取了授予整个环境root级访问权限的主管理员凭据。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">这些Agent并未止步于凭据窃取。它们通过自定义工作流劫持了该公司的CI/CD管道，以窃取云访问密钥，并试图在Terraform基础设施即代码配置中植入后门——这一企图最终被分支保护控制所阻断。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">利用窃取的云密钥，攻击者还夺取了受害者AI基础设施的控制权，将该公司自身的计算资源重新用于支持后续攻击阶段。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;text-align:right;color:#000000;margin:0 0 4px 0;padding:0 16px;\" data-pm-slice=\"2 2 []\"><span leaf=\"\">Part</span><span style=\"color:#00af00;\"><span leaf=\"\">02</span></span></p>\n  <p data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"161\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;text-align: right;color: rgb(0, 175, 0);margin: 4px 0px 16px;padding: 0px 16px;\"><strong data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"161\"><span leaf=\"\">AI驱动攻击留下明显痕迹</span></strong></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Unit42识别出了多个AI驱动运营的明显迹象，包括向多个大语言模型发起并行调用、使用结构化Markdown文件在Agent会话之间传递信息，以及带有与AI生成代码一致的UI元素的自定义脚本。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">不同寻常的是，攻击者还指示这些Agent编写了一份长达80页的受害者安全弱点技术审计报告，实际上自动化生成了一份完整的渗透测试报告作为施压筹码。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">研究人员警告称，对手越来越有可能将自主AI Agent纳入其工具库，因为该技术有助于同时跨SSH密钥、云身份和CI/CD管道建立冗余持久性。</span></p>\n  <p style=\"font-size:16px;color:#3E3E3E;line-height:1.75;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:justify;margin:0;padding:0 16px;text-indent:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">为应对机器速度级别的攻击，Unit42建议各组织部署同步的遏制手册，以便即时撤销凭据并冻结管道；将AI模型和API密钥视为需要严格治理的核心基础设施；并对基础设施即代码仓库实施强制性的多方代码审查，以阻断自动化后门注入。</span></p>\n  <div style=\"margin:24px 16px 0 16px;padding:12px 16px;border-left:3px solid #cccccc;background:#f9f9f9;\">\n   <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin:0 0 8px 0;line-height:1.6;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">参考来源：</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin:0 0 4px 0;line-height:1.6;font-weight:bold;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI Agents Breach Company Network in Under 10 Hours and Steal Root Credentials</span></p>\n   <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin:0;line-height:1.6;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://cybersecuritynews.com/ai-agents-breach-company-network/\" target=\"_blank\">https://cybersecuritynews.com/ai-agents-breach-company-network/</a></span></p>\n  </div>\n  <div data-pm-slice=\"16 1 []\">\n   <div data-pm-slice=\"4 2 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 黑体, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;pointer-events: initial;\">\n    <div data-pm-slice=\"7 2 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;6 1 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;2 1 []&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;\">\n     <div data-pm-slice=\"6 1 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;\">\n      <div data-pm-slice=\"2 1 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;\">\n       <div style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;\">\n        <div data-pm-slice=\"8 1 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 黑体, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;pointer-events: initial;\">\n         <div data-pm-slice=\"9 1 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;\">\n          <div data-pm-slice=\"2 1 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;\">\n           <div data-pm-slice=\"5 3 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;8 1 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;9 1 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;2 1 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;text-align: right;\">\n            <div data-pm-slice=\"4 2 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 黑体, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;pointer-events: initial;\">\n             <div data-pm-slice=\"2 1 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;\">\n              <p data-pm-slice=\"16 1 []\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 黑体, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;pointer-events: initial;\"></p>\n              <h3 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"margin: 0px 16px;padding: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;box-sizing: border-box !important;max-width: 100%;display: block;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: right;line-height: 1.75em;pointer-events: initial;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;pointer-events: initial;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box !important;max-width: 100%;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;outline: 0px;font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;letter-spacing: 0.578px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: right;font-size: 20px;font-weight: bold;color: rgb(0, 175, 0);pointer-events: initial;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"letter-spacing: 1px;\">推荐阅读</span></span></strong></h3>\n              <p></p>\n             </div>\n            </div>\n            <p style=\"margin: 0px 16px;padding: 0px;display: block;box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(53, 53, 53);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hir